{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The King craves treasures, and YOU are the miner tasked with finding them. Dig up the riches, and survive the dangers of the mine!</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>MINE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/b0c0c2f63861e5b0881fceaa032d3316.poster.avif?t=1758380931\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/b0c0c2f63861e5b0881fceaa032d3316.webm?t=1758380931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/b0c0c2f63861e5b0881fceaa032d3316.mp4?t=1758380931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through the mine to find different kinds of ores, each worth a different amount. From simple copper to rare adamant, everything  can be sold to make money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>GEAR UP</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/78847a44e5be237a4d0ead25839588bc.poster.avif?t=1758380931\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/78847a44e5be237a4d0ead25839588bc.webm?t=1758380931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/78847a44e5be237a4d0ead25839588bc.mp4?t=1758380931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools to become a better miner! Buy stronger equipment to dig deeper, mine faster, and uncover the rarest treasures hidden underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>OVERCOME</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/ea30dbd9d25d1d0edf23aa0924c96f2b.poster.avif?t=1758380931\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/ea30dbd9d25d1d0edf23aa0924c96f2b.webm?t=1758380931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/ea30dbd9d25d1d0edf23aa0924c96f2b.mp4?t=1758380931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the dangers lurking in the mine! Face off against goblins, spiders, and other threats as you dig deeper. Stay alert, or risk losing your hard-earned treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>TRIBUTE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/c5c853b448f1f4f5c6712118ccc530a5.poster.avif?t=1758380931\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/c5c853b448f1f4f5c6712118ccc530a5.webm?t=1758380931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/c5c853b448f1f4f5c6712118ccc530a5.mp4?t=1758380931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the King happy by delivering treasures to him before his patience runs out! Complete tributes to earn his favor and receive random magical items as a reward for your loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>WHAT TO EXPECT</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully single-player experience: no online requirements, no microtransactions, and no planned DLCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual mining gameplay: each run lasts between 5 to 40 minutes, depending on your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated mine: every run features a new mine layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent hub &amp; metaprogression: upgrade the Throne Room, improve your standing with the King and the Miners' Guild, and uncover ancient relics across multiple runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine 4 different types of ore, each with unique value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple win conditions: 3 distinct ways to complete a run, each offering its own challenge and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable mining gear: 6 different tools to enhance your mining efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic items: 8 unique magic items that grant powerful effects.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm a solo developer creating this game entirely in my spare time, with no budget and a lot of passion. Every line of code, piece of art, and design decision has been a personal labor of love, built from the ground up during evenings and weekends. I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I\u2019ve enjoyed making it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pyrrhic Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391190/3638e50a31a60a885b1c4f3fcbaa53807b4ac191.jpg"},{"name":"Getting There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391190/3c0ed689725aa77342c7bbffd7c3a38cca99d3b2.jpg"},{"name":"Grit and Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391190/3fd2b3d28f8c04c4dd8d3f17c36dc2f03c434ccd.jpg"},{"name":"Off with the Gobs!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391190/0657d20411ed7f463bec53c80deda15742509448.jpg"},{"name":"Things about to go boom!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391190/11ade847ad2d6581eaeccb74137c5276cd25930e.jpg"},{"name":"Plague Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391190/9b05ce46a7b259a91625b68bd0bec7c8d2211376.jpg"},{"name":"Pacifist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391190/2a94cc3367ca3cc29ece6b2753fb1ddc928b0222.jpg"},{"name":"Pimp my throne","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391190/dee7d087ba349773fea8787bfed55399743460ae.jpg"},{"name":"Berserker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391190/11478cf533dae9ac30556ac6f8463fe8a94cb8e8.jpg"},{"name":"Early retirement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391190/abffb991e97fc1cc2b273404cf97ea9846abf5fd.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3391190?t=1758380931","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3391190?t=1758380931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/d339419c9497ea58a6db533c4286c1e21a190f28/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758380931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/d339419c9497ea58a6db533c4286c1e21a190f28/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758380931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3630650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<