" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>OVERCOME</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/ea30dbd9d25d1d0edf23aa0924c96f2b.poster.avif?t=1758380931\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/ea30dbd9d25d1d0edf23aa0924c96f2b.webm?t=1758380931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/ea30dbd9d25d1d0edf23aa0924c96f2b.mp4?t=1758380931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the dangers lurking in the mine! Face off against goblins, spiders, and other threats as you dig deeper. Stay alert, or risk losing your hard-earned treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>TRIBUTE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/c5c853b448f1f4f5c6712118ccc530a5.poster.avif?t=1758380931\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/c5c853b448f1f4f5c6712118ccc530a5.webm?t=1758380931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/c5c853b448f1f4f5c6712118ccc530a5.mp4?t=1758380931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the King happy by delivering treasures to him before his patience runs out! Complete tributes to earn his favor and receive random magical items as a reward for your loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>WHAT TO EXPECT</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully single-player experience: no online requirements, no microtransactions, and no planned DLCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual mining gameplay: each run lasts between 5 to 40 minutes, depending on your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated mine: every run features a new mine layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent hub &amp; metaprogression: upgrade the Throne Room, improve your standing with the King and the Miners' Guild, and uncover ancient relics across multiple runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine 4 different types of ore, each with unique value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple win conditions: 3 distinct ways to complete a run, each offering its own challenge and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable mining gear: 6 different tools to enhance your mining efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic items: 8 unique magic items that grant powerful effects.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm a solo developer creating this game entirely in my spare time, with no budget and a lot of passion. Every line of code, piece of art, and design decision has been a personal labor of love, built from the ground up during evenings and weekends. I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I\u2019ve enjoyed making it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ludiminal Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/5eb950f7f6cfda1dd507dc48d8db2b615951df49/header.jpg?t=1758380931","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distribution released after 2016<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64 bit CPU<br